'Last Word':['gin','equal-parts sour','22.5 ml gin; 22.5 ml green Chartreuse; 22.5 ml maraschino; 22.5 ml lime','Shake with ice; fine-strain into chilled coupe.','Herbal, tart, sweet, pungent and tightly balanced.','A pre-Prohibition Detroit Athletic Club drink, published in the 1910s. It was revived in the modern cocktail renaissance; details of its first service are sparse.'],
