function shotsPage(root){root.innerHTML=`<div class="content-intro"><div class="eyebrow">30 MEASURED MINIATURES · OPTIONAL SERVICE</div><h1 class="display">Shots & shooters.</h1><p class="lead">A quick-reference collection of familiar short serves. Many have numerous house versions; these are small educational specs, not a prompt to drink quickly.</p></div><div class="callout"><b>Responsible service first:</b> Shots can deliver alcohol rapidly. Use measured portions, never pressure a guest, provide water and non-alcoholic choices, check age/ID and follow local law and venue policy. Some entries include allergens (dairy, shellfish, nuts) or caffeine—confirm with guests and labels. Flames are omitted for safety.</div><div class="detail-list">${shots.map((s,i)=>`<article class="mini-card"><span class="tag">SHOT ${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><b style="margin-top:8px">${s[0]}</b><small><b>Spec:</b> ${s[1]}<br><br><b>Method:</b> ${s[2]}<br><br><b>Profile:</b> ${s[3]}</small></article>`).join('')}</div>`}

